  "meta": {
    "source": "quicksheet-original",
    "note": "Original QuickSheet tables for two story aspects shown on every sheet. High concept: a short, plain phrase that sums up who the character is and what they do, either '{descriptor} {role}' (Cheerful Street Performer) or '{role} {purpose}' (Monster Hunter Out for Revenge). Trouble: something that keeps complicating their life, either a personal struggle or a problem relationship. Story prompts only, with no mechanical effect in Daggerheart. Roles are keyed by class; nothing is keyed to ancestry. Troubles may use {family} (the character's family name)."
